WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.796
A quiet break is a useful choice. You can ask before things feel too much.

2
00:00:04.796 --> 00:00:10.110
Notice your own signs that the room is getting busy. Everyone has different signs.

3
00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:15.943
Say, I need a quiet break, or show your break card. You can use the words that feel right.

4
00:00:15.943 --> 00:00:20.998
Go to the quiet place you agreed on. Ask someone to come with you if you want.

5
00:00:20.998 --> 00:00:25.729
Choose what helps you: silence, headphones, water, or a comfortable stim.

6
00:00:25.729 --> 00:00:30.331
Return when you feel ready. You can ask for more time or another break.

7
00:00:30.331 --> 00:00:35.460
Taking a break is not a failure. You are allowed to ask.
